{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/disclaimer/layout,_N_T_/disclaimer/page,_N_T_/disclaimer"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/disclaimer/__PAGE__","/disclaimer","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--pgsRmQurRr_N1dmgTeLr1--><html lang=\"id\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.3a6ba036.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ca31d6821328a4e9-s.p.8036670a.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0d86f31a0fa4a57f.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/c36392072b477bb8.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/66a8c16702b8a250.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3b5fd8f198ad7695.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/29329bdb6e017ed0.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/de2e26ab072db058.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/f091501564eb2ea3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-e8949850272beef7.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/13622ac9f698f252.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a8ae5afc46116278.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2ec2da9cf0b45a75.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/949faa242bf4405e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0c5aaa4757e3a53e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/202b956bc838ef27.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/18f38dbeee9f54d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/6d74ab1e75fdd00c.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>LuxTrade - AI Trading Journal Indonesia | Catat Trade, Deteksi Kesalahan, Naikkan Win Rate</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Trading journal dengan AI untuk trader Indonesia. Screenshot trade dari MT4/MT5, AI auto-extract data &amp; deteksi pola kesalahan berulang. Equity curve, analisis psikologi trading, risk calculator. Gratis 10 trade/bulan.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"LuxTrade\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"trading journal,jurnal trading,trading journal Indonesia,AI trading journal,jurnal trading AI,catat trade,analisis trading,forex journal,jurnal forex,equity curve,deteksi kesalahan trading,trading psikologi,risk calculator forex,MT4 journal,MT5 journal,luxtrade\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"LuxTrade - AI Trading Journal Indonesia | Catat Trade, Deteksi Kesalahan, Naikkan Win Rate\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Trading journal dengan AI untuk trader Indonesia. Screenshot trade dari MT4/MT5, AI auto-extract data &amp; deteksi pola kesalahan berulang. Gratis 10 trade/bulan.\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"LuxTrade\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/logo.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"LuxTrade - AI Trading Journal Indonesia\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"LuxTrade - AI Trading Journal Indonesia\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Trading journal dengan AI untuk trader Indonesia. Catat trade, deteksi kesalahan, naikkan win rate.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/logo.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/logo.png\"/><script>\n              (function() {\n                try {\n                  var theme = localStorage.getItem('luxtrade-theme');\n                  if (theme === 'light') {\n                    document.documentElement.classList.add('light');\n                  } else {\n                    document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');\n                  }\n                } catch(e) {\n                  document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');\n                }\n              })();\n            </script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_7b064e0d-module__MOT0tq__variable lexend_99ca8c04-module__K1QbjW__variable antialiased font-sans\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-[9999] focus:bg-blue-600 focus:text-white focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:rounded-md\">Skip to main content</a><!--$?--><template id=\"B:0\"></template><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0f051d] flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"relative w-12 h-12\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-2 border-white/10\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-2 border-transparent border-t-blue-500 animate-spin\"></div></div><p class=\"text-white/40 text-sm\">Loading...</p></div></div><!--/$--><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></section><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/66a8c16702b8a250.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0a0612] text-white\"><div class=\"fixed inset-0 -z-10\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0a0612] via-[#110a1f] to-[#0a0612]\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-blue-500/5 rounded-full blur-[150px]\"></div></div><header class=\"border-b border-white/5 bg-[#0a0612]/80 backdrop-blur-xl sticky top-0 z-50\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"LuxTrade Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-premium.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-premium.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-premium.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-200 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">LuxTrade</span></a><a href=\"/\"><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive hover:bg-accent dark:hover:bg-accent/50 h-9 px-4 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 text-white/60 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left w-4 h-4 mr-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg>Kembali</button></a></div></header><main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-8 h-8 text-red-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\">Disclaimer</h1></div><p class=\"text-white/40 mb-8\">Terakhir diperbarui: <!-- -->30 Agustus 2026</p><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500/10 via-red-500/10 to-red-500/10 border border-red-500/25 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-red-500/20 flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-6 h-6 text-red-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-300 mb-2\">Penegasan Penting</h2><p class=\"text-white/80 leading-relaxed\"><strong>LuxTrade BUKAN broker sekuritas, BUKAN pialang berjangka, BUKAN pengelola dana (investment manager), dan BUKAN penasihat investasi terdaftar.</strong> LuxTrade adalah platform perangkat lunak berbasis web (Software-as-a-Service) yang menyediakan dashboard analisis data untuk trader ritel. Kami <strong>TIDAK menerima simpanan dana, TIDAK mengeksekusi transaksi, dan TIDAK memberikan rekomendasi beli/jual instrumen keuangan apapun.</strong></p></div></div></div><div class=\"prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8\"><section><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white\">1. Identitas Layanan</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-cyan-400 mb-2\">Apa Itu LuxTrade?</h3><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed\">LuxTrade adalah platform SaaS (Software-as-a-Service) yang menyediakan dashboard dan perangkat analisis data untuk membantu trader ritel dalam mencatat, memantau, dan mengevaluasi performa perdagangan mereka. Layanan kami berfokus pada penyediaan tools teknologi informasi,<strong class=\"text-white\"> BUKAN pada penyelenggaraan kegiatan perdagangan.</strong></p></div><div class=\"bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-cyan-400 mb-2\">Yang Tidak Kami Lakukan</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-white/70\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1.5\">✕</span><span>Menyediakan platform trading atau fasilitas jual-beli instrumen keuangan</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1.5\">✕</span><span>Menjadi perantara, broker, atau pialang dalam transaksi keuangan</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1.5\">✕</span><span>Mengelola, menyimpan, atau menginvestasikan dana nasabah</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1.5\">✕</span><span>Memberikan saran investasi atau rekomendasi transaksi</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1.5\">✕</span><span>Menjamin profit atau hasil positif dari aktivitas trading pengguna</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1.5\">✕</span><span>Terdaftar atau diawasi oleh OJK, Bappebti, Bursa Efek Indonesia, atau regulator pasar modal lainnya</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-6 h-6 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white\">2. Risiko Perdagangan (Trading)</h2></div><div class=\"bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-xl p-5\"><p class=\"text-white/80 leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"text-red-300\">Perdagangan valas (forex), saham, kripto, dan instrumen keuangan lainnya memiliki risiko tinggi.</strong> Nilai investasi dapat naik maupun turun dan pengguna mungkin mengalami kerugian melebihi modal awal yang diinvestasikan. Performa masa lalu <strong>BUKAN</strong> merupakan indikator pasti dari hasil di masa mendatang.</p></div><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed mt-4\">Seluruh keputusan untuk membeli, menjual, atau memegang instrumen keuangan sepenuhnya merupakan keputusan independen pengguna. Pengguna bertanggung jawab penuh atas risiko finansial yang timbul dari kegiatan perdagangan mereka.</p></section><section><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scale w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 16 3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1Z\"></path><path d=\"m2 16 3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1Z\"></path><path d=\"M7 21h10\"></path><path d=\"M12 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M3 7h2c2 0 5-1 7-2 2 1 5 2 7 2h2\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white\">3. Batasan Tanggung Jawab</h2></div><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-4\">LuxTrade secara tegas menolak segala bentuk tanggung jawab atas:</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-white/70\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Kerugian finansial, baik langsung maupun tidak langsung, yang timbul dari kegiatan perdagangan yang dilakukan oleh pengguna</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Ketidakakuratan data, signal, atau analisis yang ditampilkan di platform. Data bersumber dari pihak ketiga dan mungkin memiliki delay atau kesalahan</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Gangguan teknis, downtime, kegagalan server, atau masalah konektivitas yang mengakibatkan keterlambatan data atau ketidaktersediaan layanan</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Tindakan pengguna berdasarkan informasi yang ditampilkan di platform</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Kehilangan data akibat force majeure, bencana alam, atau kejadian di luar kendali kami</span></li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4\">4. Sifat Informatif Layanan</h2><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Seluruh informasi, data chart, statistik, fitur analitik, dan konten yang disediakan oleh LuxTrade bersifat <strong class=\"text-white\">informatif dan edukatif</strong>. Informasi tersebut <strong class=\"text-white\">BUKAN</strong> merupakan:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-white/70\"><li>Saran investasi (investment advice)</li><li>Rekomendasi jual-beli (trade recommendation)</li><li>Jaminan keuntungan di masa depan</li><li>Analisis fundamental atau teknikal yang disahkan oleh ahli keuangan</li><li>Persetujuan atau penolakan atas keputusan trading pengguna</li></ul><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed mt-4\">Pengguna dianjurkan untuk selalu melakukan riset mandiri (DYOR - Do Your Own Research) dan berkonsultasi dengan penasihat keuangan profesional yang terdaftar sebelum mengambil keputusan investasi.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4\">5. Perjanjian Pengguna</h2><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed\">Dengan menggunakan LuxTrade, Anda mengakui dan menyetujui bahwa:</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-white/70 mt-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Anda memahami risiko yang melekat pada perdagangan instrumen keuangan</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Anda bertanggung jawab sepenuhnya atas keputusan trading Anda</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>LuxTrade bukan merupakan substitute untuk konsultasi profesional</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Anda tidak akan menuntut LuxTrade atas kerugian yang timbul dari trading</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Anda menggunakan platform ini atas kehendak sendiri (voluntary basis)</span></li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4\">6. Data Pihak Ketiga</h2><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed\">LuxTrade menampilkan data pasar keuangan yang bersumber dari penyedia data pihak ketiga (third-party data providers). Meskipun kami berupaya menyajikan data yang akurat, kami tidak menjamin keakuratan, kelengkapan, atau kekinian data tersebut. Pengguna disarankan untuk memverifikasi informasi penting dari sumber resmi sebelum mengambil keputusan trading.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4\">7. Hukum yang Berlaku</h2><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed\">Disclaimer ini diatur oleh dan ditafsirkan sesuai dengan hukum Republik Indonesia. Segala sengketa yang timbul dari atau terkait dengan disclaimer ini akan diselesaikan melalui musyawarah terlebih dahulu, dan apabila tidak tercapai kesepakatan, akan diselesaikan melalui Badan Arbitrase Nasional Indonesia (BANI) di Jakarta.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4\">8. Hubungi Kami</h2><p class=\"text-white/70 leading-relaxed\">Jika Anda memiliki pertanyaan mengenai disclaimer ini, silakan hubungi kami:</p><div class=\"bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-5 mt-4 space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-white/70\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-400\">Email:</strong> luxtradee@gmail.com</p><p class=\"text-white/70\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-400\">Discord:</strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KkYYFP9nC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#5865F2] hover:underline\">LuxTrade Server</a></p><p class=\"text-white/70\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-400\">Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://luxtradee.web.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">luxtradee.web.id</a></p></div></section></div></div></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/5 py-8 mt-12\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center text-white/40 text-sm\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> LuxTrade. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex justify-center gap-6 mt-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\"